s/steam/apps/688540/extras/9eac27b5903ee2275935179007a30a8a.mp4?t=1728295321\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><strong>GAME MODES</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>RAID: ( NOT AVAILABLE, Works in progress )</strong><br>Raid infected city, kill zombies and collect loot. Beware of other raiders on your way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>SQUAD COMBAT:</strong><br>Unite in squads of four, where each character contributes to victory with unique abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>DEATHMATCH:</strong><br>Showcase your unique character build in a &quot;everyone for themselves&quot; mode, where selected perks and upgraded weapons can turn the tide of battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>DUEL: ( NOT AVAILABLE, Works in progress )</strong><br>Test your abilities in one-on-one PvP duels, demonstrating the strength of your chosen playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>HORDE:</strong><br>Cooperate with other players, using both upgraded weapons and personal perks to withstand endless waves of zombies.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/688540/extras/38cc483488ddd2692b30e63a21454d58.avif?t=1728295321\" /></div></p></li></ul>",
